    "description": "### Summary\r\nHi. The following issue was identified using Aikido's AI pentest service.\r\n\r\nA low privileged user (member) can see and use invitation links sent to an administrator. When they use the link before the legitimate recipient does, they are able to log in as an administrator, meaning they have successfully escalated their privileges.\r\n\r\n### PoC\r\n<img width=\"2237\" height=\"363\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56be3706-f1ec-4c30-911e-1a5252059c50\" />\r\n\r\n### Impact\r\nPrivilege escalation\r\n",
